# Urdu (اردو) message catalogue for Madrasah Library.
#
# Every msgstr here is deliberately empty. An empty msgstr makes
# gettext return the msgid, so the application still renders in
# English and every existing test still passes - which is what
# makes this catalogue safe to keep in the repository before a
# translator has seen it. Fill in one msgstr and that string, and
# only that string, starts appearing in Urdu.
#
# Regenerate after marking new strings:
#
#   manage.py makemessages -l ur -l ar --ignore=venv
#       --ignore=staticfiles --ignore=backups --ignore=media
#       --ignore=private --ignore=scripts --ignore=locale
#
# Do not hand-edit the line references; they come from the scan.
